      "cooked": "<p>Handelabra have announced that one of their (next 2) future projects will be Spirit Island.</p><p><a href=\"http://www.pixelatedcardboard.com/handelabra-announces-next-two-game/\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">http://www.pixelatedcardboard.com/handelabra-announces-next-two-game/</a></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>From the above</p><blockquote><p><span>Handelabra has the digital rights to make Spirit Island and will begin work in late 2018 or early 2019.</span></p></blockquote><p>Well, this will be interesting. Is it 2020 yet?</p><p>&nbsp;</p>",
